<title>USA: Group cuts Pharmaceutical Marketing stake.</title>
<headline>Group cuts Pharmaceutical Marketing stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Source Information Inc  and its unit SI PMSI Ltd said Friday they reduced their stake in Pharmaceutical Marketing Services Inc to 7.9 percent or 1,041,144 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said SI PMSI sold 160,000 shares of Pharmaceutical Marketing between Nov 27 and Dec 31 at $9.04 to $11.06 per share.</p>
</text>
